              "type": "Text",
              "value": "D1R occupancy closely tracks extracellular DA with approximately 50 ms delay during burst firing; D1R occupancy is negligible during pacemaker activity because the EC50 of 1000 nM far exceeds tonic [DA] of ~10 nM in DS, making burst events the effective threshold for D1R engagement."
