        {
          "type": "Claim",
          "identifier": "nanoclustering-model-varicosity-scale",
          "role": "scope",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "Text",
              "value": "The nanoclustering simulations (Figure 4C–F) operate in a standalone varicosity-scale model (1.8 × 1.8 µm domain, 0.02 µm voxels) architecturally separate from the tissue-level model used in Figures 1–3 (100 µm domain, 1 µm voxels); no formal coupling exists between the two models and no effective-Vmax output from the nanoclustering simulation feeds into the tissue simulation."
            }
          ],
          "epistemicStrength": "moderate",
